      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hojja lafa qoodani gosa Israeli ch'ufa qooda isii kennanifi, qooda toko ha eebisani AABBO Waaqaa koba kayani. Qooda suni, d'eerinni isaa ejata kuma kud'ani lamafi d'ibba shani, ballinnileeni ejata kuma kud'ani. Lafti sunini ch'ufti, haguma geetunu, qulqullo taati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qooda kana keesa, fullaani Mana Waaqa iti jaarani jiraachu malte. Fulla suni, d'eerinni moga isii ch'ufti ejata d'ibba lamatifi shantama tahu male. Ammalle fulla tana lafa ballinni isii ejata diddami shanitini marsu malani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa qulqullo tana moga toko, ta d'eerinni isii ejata kuma kud'ani lamafi d'ibba shani, ta ammalle ballinni ejata kuma shani, ha biimani qooda kaani iraa kutani. Duuba fulla suniti Mana Waaqa ka waan ch'ufa ira qulqullo jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fullaani sunini lafa suni keesa Fulla qulqullo taati, ta qaalole Mana AABBO Waaqa keesa hojatuu kennani. Ammalle artumati maneeni worraatifi Mana Waaqale jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafa qulqullo tana moga hafte taani d'ibi ha worra Lawi, ka Mana Waaqa keesa hojatu, kennani. Ammalle dira worri iti galule ch'ufa achumati jaarani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'aatu lafa qulqullo suni lafa d'ibi ta d'eerinni isii ejata kuma kud'ani lamatifi d'ibba shani ta ballinnileeni ejata kuma lamatifi d'ibba shani ha biimani koba baasani worra Israeliti kennani, aka worri dira iti jaarate iti galu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Qooda lafa ka hayyuu kennani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle hayyu lafa mohatu qooda lafaa kennuufi malani, qoodi lafa suni ha lafaa qulqullo suni, moga isii ta ila adu iraa bahe, ilaadu qajeele, baariini guddati ejuti; ammalle moga isii ta ilaboru seeri ha ilaboru qajeele, seera lafa ka ilaboruti ejuti duuba akanaani d'eerinni lafa suni qooda lafa, ta gosa Israeliti kennani wolqit'e taha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fullaani tunini qooda lafa hayyuuni Israeli mohatu taati. Duuba innileeni deebie gumi tiyya indabsu, ammo lafa hafte taani ch'ufa gumi Israeliti lakisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Seera hayyuuni gula deemu male",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, Hayyoota Israeli, isani bara heddu ch'ubbu tolchitani! Ule isani nama d'aantanifi daba isani nama dabsatani suni lakisa. Waan d'ugaatifi ka qajeela tolcha. Deebitani gumi tiyya lafa isaani keesaa ingussina, nami dubbi tana isaniini jechu jiru ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
