    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efafi bathini biimani qit'e tahu malte. Bathini kud'ani homeri toko, efani kud'anileeni homeri toko; biima waan ch'ufa homeri tanaani beekhani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti isani woini biimitani tana tau malte: Gerani diddama shekeli toko; shekelini jaatama mina toko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biimani waan isani Waaqaa baaftani tana: Dargaye: mid'aani isani haamatani ch'ufa keesa, hid'aansa jaatama keesa, toko Waaqaa baasa, garbu: mid'aani isani haamatani ch'ufa keesa, hid'aansa jaatama keesa toko Waaqaa baasa. D'ad'a: qooda d'ibba keesaa toko Waaqa baasa. (D'ad'a kana woni bathi jed'ani kaaniini biima: Bathini kud'ani homeri toko yokhaani kori toko.) Hooliye: Hooliye d'ibba lama keesa toko Waaqaa baasa. Ammalle isani mid'aani Waaqaa baasanifi hori gubani sorio baasanifi hori sorio wold'ageeti baasanile baasu maltani, aka akasiini ch'ubbu teesani isanii araaramani. Nami dubbi tana jed'e ana, AABBO Waaqa gudda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.13+EZK.45.14+EZK.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.13",
              "EZK.45.14",
              "EZK.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
