            "sid": "EZK 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi guddaani waan jed'e, guyya qara ka jia qara, atini jibicha korma, ka aabo womatu inqamne, sorio qalte, Mana Waaqa qulqulleesu malte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba qaallichi d'iiga sorio dabaani nama iraa baasani suni haga toko fuud'e, mikhikila Mana Waaqatifi mesa sorio irati baasani kaani moga afraniifi, ammalle mikhikila balbala fullo naabo ta garaa keesa ibsaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jia ch'ufa, guyya torbeeso, atini maro nama danu ch'ubbu tolcheetifi nama wollaala keesa ch'ubbu seenele jette, akasuma tolchu malte. Kara kanaani atini Mana Waaqa qulqulleesita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
