          "text": " Guyya kud'ani shaneeso, ka jia torbeeso, ka jila Hoosa, hayyichi bulti torbaani jila suni guyya ch'ufa sorio akasi, ta dabaani nama iraa baasanifi ammalle hori gubani sorio baasanile baasuu male.",
